{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../faq/the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated/", "title": "The account has been limited/deactivated"}, "next": {"link": "../telegram/functions/", "title": "Raw Functions"}, "title": "Release Notes", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"release-notes\">\n<h1>Release Notes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#release-notes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Release notes for Pyrogram releases will describe what\u2019s new in each version, and will also make you aware of any backwards-incompatible changes made in that version.</p>\n<p>When upgrading to a new version of Pyrogram, you will need to check all the changes in order to find incompatible code in your application, but also to take advantage of new features and improvements.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"changes-in-this-fork/\"><span class=\"doc\">Changes in this Fork</span></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241127113824/https://docs.pyrogram.org/releases/\">Previous Changes</a>.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["telegram/functions/index", "Raw Functions", "N", "next"], ["faq/the-account-has-been-limited-deactivated", "The account has been limited/deactivated", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Release Notes</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "releases/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}